"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-04-09T11:36:32Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T14:12:17Z","closed_at":"2026-05-14T14:12:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nA regression from #115119.\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.7.dev3.official [60fff00a660a2aeb03f88c07fb7baed353bcb72f]\n- Not reproducible in: v4.7.dev2.official [778cf54da]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (755fa449c) - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon 780M Graphics (RADV PHOENIX) - AMD Ryzen 7 8745H w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads) - 25.22 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis issue may be specific to i3/sway (Xwayland). Not reproducible on sway (Wayland).\n\nAfter launching the editor, hovering the mouse over properties in the Inspector displays tooltips correctly.\n\nHowever, after moving the editor between workspaces, hovering the mouse over properties in the Inspector fails to display tooltips properly.\n\nBisected to d418d692b91952ae5f3f0fb3d58fd0300b3089d2 #115119, the editor built from this commit failed to launch. However, bb1e018314bdb5bccb3d16405c584dd69fe108e9 is reproducible, while c86601bc4d290748939d23f0219a02563de77d45 is not. See [Commits](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commits/master/?after=eb516e3d126b7c79f0cbdf8184d90200f0375cdf+0). CC @Nintorch \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/755fa449c4aa94fdf2c58e2b726fd62efde07e09/core/input/input.cpp#L319-L321\n\nAfter moving, `keys_pressed` is not empty when hovering the mouse over the property.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/755fa449c4aa94fdf2c58e2b726fd62efde07e09/editor/doc/editor_help.cpp#L4967-L4969\n\nThis results in no pop-ups being generated.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Launch the editor in Workspace 1 and open any project.\n2. At this point, hovering the mouse over a property in the Inspector causes tooltips to appear as expected.\n3. Move the editor to Workspace 2 (`$mod+Shift+2`), then switch to Workspace 2 (`$mod+2`).\n4. At this point, hovering the mouse over a property in the Inspector prevents tooltips from appearing.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118341/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118341/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}